# The standard library 1.0 surface (N84, `docs/architecture.md` §7.85): every public item of every
# standard module, one per line, `@std/MODULE` then its declaration. Regenerated by
# `every_public_standard_item_is_in_the_1_0_manifest`; a difference fails it. Within 1.x a line
# may be added, never removed or changed: a removal or change is 2.0 (`docs/spec.md`, *Stability*).
